1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,197
Look alikes.

2
00:00:01,197 --> 00:00:04,114
Because with a clause, because of with a noun.

3
00:00:04,114 --> 00:00:07,109
Although with a clause, in spite of with a noun.

4
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:10,768
Beside means next to; besides means in addition to.

5
00:00:10,768 --> 00:00:13,294
So with an adjective, such with a noun.

6
00:00:13,294 --> 00:00:16,757
Too means more than is acceptable: too hot to drink.

7
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:20,208
And since marks a point of time, for a length of time.

